# NOTE: docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored — it is the GitHub Pages
# publishing root for this repo (Pages source: main:/docs, legacy build).
# The previous Python-template .gitignore had a bare `lib/` rule that silently
# excluded src/lib/appdeploy-client.ts, which broke the CI build.
